{"id":"vod_sn_63798","vodId":"63798","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"背骑少女","name_cn":"背骑少女","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20240218-1/ccc5980fbcfb3c9ca597b5b063d0f6b6.jpg"},"summary":"尾行琳（水树奈奈 配音）的母亲是一位著名的芭蕾舞演员，母亲优雅的身姿深深的映在琳的眼眸深处，琳以成为和母亲一样的芭蕾舞演员为目标开始了努力。然而，一场大地震夺走了母亲的生命，之后，琳又因为受伤而再也无法跳芭蕾，无奈之中放弃了梦想。\r\n　　琳进入了武藏野文艺大学，成为了校园中的新鲜人，某日偶然之中，琳来到了“Rideback部”门前，推开门，见到了名为菱田春树（上田佑司 配音）的男子以及一台“Rideback”，这一瞬间，琳的命运被改变了。成熟稳重的基弗（森川智之 配音）、大大咧咧元气满满的片冈珠代（朴璐美 配音）等人接二连三的出现在琳的身边，他们同为Rideback的骑手，拥有同样澄澈向往自由的灵魂。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-02-18 18:22:23","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v8.rstu6.com/202402/18/GivpHXFbLh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v8.rstu6.com/202402/18/PGkcGQYUsY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v8.rstu6.com/202402/18/SKrUaNHzCA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v8.rstu6.com/202402/18/eeMPy7Arna1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v8.rstu6.com/202402/18/ZqRG25KapJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v8.rstu6.com/202402/18/QU04mmDWkv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v8.rstu6.com/202402/18/6E8awTcbHh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v8.rstu6.com/202402/18/NDcFv9LDcQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v8.rstu6.com/202402/18/eyYH0zr5v91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v8.rstu6.com/202402/18/g1310Dz5Ks1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v8.rstu6.com/202402/18/3Gy8qZj5JM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v8.rstu6.com/202402/18/Cmu89Gqd1L1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:45.993Z"}